 resolution, 320x240 and your window override to 1280x960 and include a canvas-layer with a label on it with a simple \"get_frames_per_second\" script\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[exp-01.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21045938/exp-01.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108253/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108253/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}